{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港股先跌後回穩。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">恒指低開152點，見了半日低位後，走勢反覆回穩。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">市場擔心騰訊資本開支增加，影響短期業績表現，股價下跌近百分之4。今日除淨的滙控，上升百分之1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T05:40:22.095463+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}